{"actions": [], "code_blocks": [], "content_units": ["Best Route for Converting 1,000 USD to JPY", "With a   1.5% fee applied at every conversion step  , the cheapest path is the one that leaves you with the   most JPY after fees  .", "Using your rates, the best route is   USD → EUR → JPY  .", "Conversion Math by Path", "Formula: Final amount after each step = Initial amount × rate × \\(1 - 0.015\\)", "Path   Steps   Math   Final JPY", "Direct   USD → JPY   \\(1000 \\times 148 \\times 0.985\\)     145,780 JPY", "Via EUR   USD → EUR → JPY   \\(1000 \\times 0.92 \\times 0.985 \\times 161 \\times 0.985\\)     145,841.962 JPY", "Via CAD   USD → CAD → JPY   \\(1000 \\times 1.35 \\times 0.985 \\times 109 \\times 0.985\\)     143,288.6625 JPY", "Route-by-Route Breakdown", "Direct: USD → JPY", "- Start with   1,000 USD", "- Convert at   148 JPY per USD  :", "\\(1000 \\times 148 = 148,000\\) JPY", "- Apply   1.5% fee  :", "\\(148,000 \\times 0.985 = 145,780\\) JPY", "Through EUR: USD → EUR → JPY", "- Step 1: USD to EUR", "\\(1000 \\times 0.92 = 920\\) EUR", "- Fee after step 1:", "\\(920 \\times 0.985 = 906.2\\) EUR", "- Step 2: EUR to JPY", "\\(906.2 \\times 161 = 145,898.2\\) JPY", "- Fee after step 2:", "\\(145,898.2 \\times 0.985 = 145,841.962\\) JPY", "Through CAD: USD → CAD → JPY", "- Step 1: USD to CAD", "\\(1000 \\times 1.35 = 1350\\) CAD", "- Fee after step 1:", "\\(1350 \\times 0.985 = 1329.75\\) CAD", "- Step 2: CAD to JPY", "\\(1329.75 \\times 109 = 144,942.75\\) JPY", "- Fee after step 2:", "\\(144,942.75 \\times 0.985 = 143,288.6625\\) JPY", "Highest-Yen Outcome", "Best path: USD → EUR → JPY", "It gives you   145,841.96 JPY  , which is:", "-   61.96 JPY more   than direct conversion", "-   2,553.30 JPY more   than routing through CAD", "Calculation Context", "- Fee assumed to be taken multiplicatively at each conversion step as   1.5%  , so each step keeps   98.5%   of the converted amount.", "- Rounded display values to   2 decimals   where helpful; ranking is unchanged."], "contract_version": "1.0.0", "exact_values": ["0.015", "0.92", "0.92", "0.985", "0.985", "0.985", "0.985", "0.985", "0.985", "0.985", "0.985", "0.985", "0.985", "1", "1", "1", "1", "1", "1 000 usd", "1 000 usd", "1.11", "1.11", "1.11", "1.35", "1.35", "1.5%", "1.5%", "1.5%", "1000", "1000", "1000", "1000", "1000", "1000", "109", "109", "1329.75", "1329.75", "1350", "1350", "143 288.6625", "143 288.6625", "144 942.75", "144 942.75", "145 780", "145 780", "145 841.96", "145 841.962", "145 841.962", "145 898.2", "145 898.2", "148", "148", "148", "148 000", "148 000", "161", "161", "2", "2", "2", "2", "2", "2 553.30", "3", "3", "3", "61.96", "906.2", "906.2", "920", "920", "98.5%"], "expected_role_counts": {"action": 0, "audio": 0, "chart": 0, "code": 0, "console": 0, "email": 0, "formula": 1, "image": 0, "table": 1, "video": 0}, "extractor_version": "1.0.0", "headings": ["Best Route for Converting 1,000 USD to JPY", "Conversion Math by Path", "Route-by-Route Breakdown", "Direct: USD → JPY", "Through EUR: USD → EUR → JPY", "Through CAD: USD → CAD → JPY", "Highest-Yen Outcome", "Calculation Context"], "inline_code": [], "intent": "information_retrieval", "media": [{"kind": "Icon", "required": true, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/currency-rupee.svg"}, {"kind": "Icon", "required": true, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/signpost-split.svg"}, {"kind": "Icon", "required": true, "url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/signpost-split.svg"}], "required_roles": {"action": false, "audio": false, "chart": false, "code": false, "console": false, "email": false, "formula": true, "image": false, "table": true, "video": false}, "source_hash": "6715b925161d49fff40872e7aa23441abb4da24fbc7da38138288a826c81df5d", "source_links": [], "tables": [{"headers": ["Path", "Steps", "Math", "Final JPY"], "required": true, "rows": [["Direct", "USD → JPY", "\\(1000 \\times 148 \\times 0.985\\)"